<section class="dark" id="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">Why Dealer Flywheel</p>
        <h2>Built around your dealership, not a software catalog.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="diff diff5">
      <div>
        <h3>Vendor-neutral</h3>
        <p>We don't sell software or receive commissions for recommending a particular platform. If the right solution already exists, we'll help you implement it. If there is a gap, we'll determine the most practical way to address it.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Built around your dealership</h3>
        <p>Every dealership has different systems, processes and people. We don't force your operation into a generic automation package. We start with your operation and build from there.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Measured, not promised</h3>
        <p>We establish a baseline before implementation and measure the same process afterward: response time, appointment rate, funding time, exception volume, adoption, whatever matters to the project. You shouldn't have to take our word that it worked.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Knowledge stays with the store</h3>
        <p>Every implemented workflow comes with training and documented process guidance. When an employee leaves, the process doesn't leave with them.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Local implementation</h3>
        <p>Dealer Flywheel is based on Long Island and built to work directly with dealerships across Nassau and Suffolk. When the work calls for being in the store, we can be there.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

